    flavor: '"What sort of life is that, huddling in the familiar and safe? No thanks. Put me right in the center of the action."',
    sources: [{ label: 'Card: Kaza, Roil Chaser (ZNR #225) — Legendary Creature — Human Wizard, 비행·신속, 한국어판 \'탁류 추적자, 카자\'', url: 'https://scryfall.com/card/znr/225/ko' }, { label: 'The Legends of Zendikar Rising (2020-09-15) — Kaza: \'a flying wizard\'s staff from technology she found in the Skyclaves\', \'the Sea Gate restoration efforts\'', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/legends-zendikar-rising-2020-09-15' }, { label: 'Magic Story: Episode 3 — The Dangerous Climb, the Long Fall (2020-09-16) — \'far below, Kaza appeared, hovering on her magic staff, with Orah clinging to her waist\'', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-dangerous-climb-long-fall-2020-09-16' }, { label: 'Magic Story: Episode 4 (2020-09-23) — \'after she reunited with Orah and Kaza at Sunder Bay\'', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-4-haunting-songs-and-whispered-warnings-2020-09-23' }, { label: 'Red Route (2020-09-04) — \'Away from Sea Gate, and Kaza, and Orah.\'', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/red-route-2020-09-04' }],
